    "methods_description": "Each trial lasted 6498 ms, consisting of 1000 ms fixation, 1500 ms encoding, and 3998 ms delay periods. Trials for each channel were concatenated into a single one-dimensional array and padded with zeros to ensure equal length across channels for .edf format compliance. Artifact rejection was performed at the single-trial level, resulting in unmatched trial indices across channels, with trial matching information provided in the sourcedata folder.",
